# Boolean fit gates (scripts/gate.sh): `<part> empty` must render zero
# facets; `<part> interferes` must render some — the mandatory negative
# control proving the check can fail.
#
# fit-pins / fit-pins-shift: pins at pcb_screw_positions(RPI4) rise through
#   the printed standoff pilots — empty proves the standoff pattern is
#   generated from the vitamin's hole list, and the 0.6 mm shifted copy must
#   interfere with the pilot walls.
# fit-lid / fit-lid-crush: the lid seated 0.05 mm high must clear every wall
#   and post; seated 1 mm low (a crushed seat) must overlap the wall tops.
fit-pins empty
fit-pins-shift interferes
fit-lid empty
fit-lid-crush interferes
